# Normalise text to LF in the repository. The CI runners, the Docker build and the
# shell snippets inside the workflows are all POSIX; a CRLF that slips in from a Windows
# editor turns a heredoc or a shebang into a confusing runtime failure.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Serialized emulators must never be touched by line-ending conversion.
*.joblib binary
*.parquet binary
*.pkl binary
*.db binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
